  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">BAKU URBAN TRANSPORT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to improve traffic access and safety within the Baku metropolitan area through implementation of traffic management measures and improvement of parking.  The traffic congestion situation in Baku is rapidly deteriorating. The intensity of traffic flows sharply increases during morning and evening peak hours,as well during noon time. Traffic congestion is gradually spreading over new transport arteries and is lasting longer periods of time. As traffic volumes increase and the carrying capacity of the roads under present conditions close to their maximum, congestion will increase at disproportionately higher rate, unless urgent counter measures are undertaken. The main project development objective is to reduce transportation time and improve traffic access and safety within the Baku metropolitan area, through implementation of traffic management measures, improvement of parking conditions, improvement of the concessioning of passenger transport services and  establishment of an institution responsible for development and implementation of traffic management measures  in Baku. 10-7-10 TTL changed from Mohammed Dalil Essakali to Jung Eun Oh.</narrative>
  </description>
